    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1672">

                <pb facs="1323" n="1313" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1313"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.93/8–1149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Clark</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">at Canton</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-12T15:00:00-04:00">August 12, 1949—3
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>TelCan 553. ReCantel 893, Aug 11,<anchor n="25" xml:id="d1672-f1"/> question
                    whether or not completely close Canton ConGen expected be decided later today in
                    consultation with new advisory group recently appointed to counsel on policy
                    matters.</p>
                <p>Meanwhile, you are authorized close EmbOff Canton whenever in your judgment this
                    move desirable and make any necessary preparations departure personnel who shld
                    proceed first to Hong Kong. Re Canton’s tel 267 Aug 8, ConGen staff shld be
                    reduced to skeleton framework and preparations made for travel departing
                    personnel. Dept relies ur and Rankin’s judgment general lines reduction, but
                    inform Dept soonest for its info. In forefront considerations in selection
                    departing personnel shld be length of duty at post, health and family status.
                    Administrative instrs re closure and future assignment departs will be subject
                    sep[arate] tel.</p>
                <p>You shld immed notify Amers ur area by most expeditious means of closure EmbOff
                    and state that no assurance can be given that ConGen will not likewise be closed
                    and staff withdrawn prior to Commie arrival near Canton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
